{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/baeb37f1f5b99d533cab1674d0e890dd.avif?t=1765740084\" width=1560 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/f196e65baf973c5212b0b0e75dee4a00.poster.avif?t=1765740084\" width=616 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/f196e65baf973c5212b0b0e75dee4a00.webm?t=1765740084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/f196e65baf973c5212b0b0e75dee4a00.mp4?t=1765740084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned deep in the forest, <strong>Gretel &amp; Hansel</strong> must use every trick they know to survive the journey home. Along the way, they\u2019ll face devious puzzles, sinister creatures, and an all-seeing, ever-hungry witch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/143279b67390f6abba4a4da61f431e2f.avif?t=1765740084\" width=1560 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/289ab7239e3789d6b4fa84604298d563.poster.avif?t=1765740084\" width=616 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/289ab7239e3789d6b4fa84604298d563.webm?t=1765740084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/289ab7239e3789d6b4fa84604298d563.mp4?t=1765740084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Gretel &amp; Hansel</i> \u201ctreats\u201d players to <strong>50+ uniquely animated deaths</strong>\u2014some absurd, others chilling. Dying isn\u2019t failure here\u2014it\u2019s part of the fun. In fact, death may reveal secrets, unlock treasures, or open new paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/7647467d3b8f74f05e9eed2c30874033.avif?t=1765740084\" width=1560 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/3326aba340d81ff8bddce176763df78f.poster.avif?t=1765740084\" width=616 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/3326aba340d81ff8bddce176763df78f.webm?t=1765740084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/3326aba340d81ff8bddce176763df78f.mp4?t=1765740084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with Gretel\u2019s trusty <strong>slingshot</strong>, pointing and clicking becomes pointing and shooting.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break windows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pester squirrels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annoy your brother.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up something you <i>really</i> shouldn\u2019t have...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This highly interactive world rewards curiosity, mischief, and thinking outside the cauldron.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/07a10aae9badce76eeaa5d2ab392c179.avif?t=1765740084\" width=1560 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/c5c8771ec97966f9062829142cbbe102.poster.avif?t=1765740084\" width=616 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/c5c8771ec97966f9062829142cbbe102.webm?t=1765740084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/c5c8771ec97966f9062829142cbbe102.mp4?t=1765740084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafted from <strong>hundreds of original watercolor paintings</strong>, every character, tree, shadow, and magic spell has been meticulously painted on paper and brought to life in a rich, 2.5D world. The result? A haunting storybook come to life\u2014equal parts beautiful and menacing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/34b331cb33efb26a7641755aa8b6d07f.avif?t=1765740084\" width=1560 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initially released in 2009 and 2010, <i>Gretel &amp; Hansel: Part 1 </i>and<i> Gretel &amp; Hansel: Part 2</i> were played over 4.7 million times and ranked #1 on Newgrounds upon release. Now, 15 years later, the twisted fairytale returns\u2014completely reimagined, fully hand-painted, and joined by the long-awaited <i>Part 3</i>. Get ready for the highly anticipated return of this fan favorite!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/e9f8b89b557473ffefeca935e353b17c.avif?t=1765740084\" width=1560 height=156 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ Animated Deaths</strong> \u2013 Terrifying, hilarious, or both.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ Costumes</strong> \u2013 Some grant special powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ Slingshots </strong>\u2013 Fire, ice, fireworks, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ Fairy Tokens</strong> \u2013 Unlock new secrets and extras.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet a robot doggy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poke a bear!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your evil twin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cuddle a bunny!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crash a birthday party.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have a dance off!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/67dfef13c332494903c88331b5786a3c.poster.avif?t=1765740084\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/67dfef13c332494903c88331b5786a3c.webm?t=1765740084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3299820?t=1765740084","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/0133bc5a397eb8216a5abda1aab8af70197df677/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765740084","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/e25f43be55871952dc3d4d97947ddcd319f3ec32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765740084","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/e25f43be55871952dc3d4d97947ddcd319f3ec32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765740084","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game features stylized cartoon violence and depictions of death. The playable character can die in a variety of ways, many of which include gore and blood effects. All visuals are highly stylized, presented in a hand-painted watercolor art style with simplified, cartoon-like characters, and the violence is presented in a surreal, non-realistic manner."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4111940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_