_paragraph\" >Annoy your brother.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up something you <i>really</i> shouldn\u2019t have...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This highly interactive world rewards curiosity, mischief, and thinking outside the cauldron.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/07a10aae9badce76eeaa5d2ab392c179.avif?t=1765740084\" width=1560 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/c5c8771ec97966f9062829142cbbe102.poster.avif?t=1765740084\" width=616 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/c5c8771ec97966f9062829142cbbe102.webm?t=1765740084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/c5c8771ec97966f9062829142cbbe102.mp4?t=1765740084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafted from <strong>hundreds of original watercolor paintings</strong>, every character, tree, shadow, and magic spell has been meticulously painted on paper and brought to life in a rich, 2.5D world. The result? A haunting storybook come to life\u2014equal parts beautiful and menacing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299820/extras/34b331cb